{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1479655-aeon-leviathan-layout","id":1479655,"title":"[Aeon] Leviathan Layout","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-28T09:30:53-07:00","id":1479655,"title":"[Aeon] Leviathan Layout","content":"One of my great complaints about the old WW system for Aeon was that they never offered floor plans for anything. It seems Onyx Path is following in their footsteps. Which is especially annoying as they have a Story Book out which specifically takes place on one. <br /> <br /> Does anyone have a custom floor plan for a Leviathan? Perhaps something they drew up for a previous game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27178-leighmonroe","name":"Leighmonroe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-01T02:05:45-07:00","id":1479874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leighmonroe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1479655-aeon-leviathan-layout#post1479655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of my great complaints about the old WW system for Aeon was that they never offered floor plans for anything. It seems Onyx Path is following in their footsteps.</div> </div> </div> </div>Leviathans are big. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/VonAether/status/1331319522855432194\" target=\"_blank\">Extremely big</a>. The Enterprise-D is 641 m long (2103 feet). A Star Destroyer is 1600 m long (5249 feet). A Leviathan is slightly smaller than that, at 1500m (4921 feet).<br /> <br /> The amount of detail work required to create blueprints/floor plan for a ship the size of a Leviathan is <i>very </i>much out of our budget. It isn't just a simple oversight on our part. It's an incredible amount of work, and unlike a property like Star Trek or Star Wars, we're unlikely to see a return on that particular investment. The <a href=\"https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Trek:_The_Next_Generation_USS_Enterprise_NCC-1701-D_Blueprints\" target=\"_blank\">Enterprise-D blueprints</a> -- which I remind you is a much smaller ship than a Leviathan -- took Rich Sternbach <i>18 months</i> to complete. Sales were low enough that they haven't bothered following up with more, even 25 years later.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leighmonroe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1479655-aeon-leviathan-layout#post1479655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which is especially annoying as they have a Story Book out which specifically takes place on one.</div> </div> </div> </div>With the caveat that it's very early in the morning as I write this, there's no such product that I'm aware of offhand. You may be thinking of some Storypath Nexus material. All Storypath Nexus titles are community-created content.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Does anyone have a custom floor plan for a Leviathan? Perhaps something they drew up for a previous game? </div> </div> </div>The Storypath Nexus has &quot;Leviathan: Mabuhay,&quot; which details the crew of one particular Leviathan. But no floor plans there, sorry.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/299875/Leviathan-Mabuhay\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...iathan-Mabuhay</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-01T09:30:28-07:00","id":1479899,"title":"","content":"Honestly, none of the Startreks series had the floor plan of the various ships and the stories are told anyway.<br /> Luke and Han saved Leia in the Death Star without we seen a proper map of it. Even small ships like the Falcon worked fine with no reference of where you are inside it.<br /> <br /> Its perfectly fine to have a general description of the ship, with no plan, and still have an wonderful game around it. Sure, its not going to be a dungeon crawl, but you can have your characters lost in the ship in the case of a blackout without needing to force the players pretending they dont know where the characters are.<br /> <br /> Also, my experience working on big ships offshore, the map of the ship helpes you little when you are in the inner corridors with no windows, no signs and nobody to help you...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}